			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732120601,
					"content": "（空空如也的破木箱，被人隨意地丟棄在這裡，無力地倒在路邊。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "調查"
				},
				{
					"id": 732120602,
					"content": "咦，這個木箱一定是車隊的吧，上面有部族的標誌呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732120603,
					"content": "這裡的地形很適合伏擊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120604
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732120604,
					"content": "說得是呢…這個位置，一看就很凶險！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732120605,
					"content": "就連大件物資也被搶奪一空了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120606
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732120606,
					"content": "他們搬走了物資，但是留下了空箱子…嗯，他們的人數應該不少，而且缺少搬運木箱的工具。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732120607,
					"content": "或者，這是他們的計謀…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120608
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732120608,
					"content": "欸…？計謀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732120609,
					"content": "難道這些空箱是他們故意留下來的…為了引人上鉤嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732120610,
					"content": "為了引我們上鉤。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120611
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732120611,
					"content": "嗚哇…我汗毛都要起來了！那我們還要不要繼續往前探查呀…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120612,
						732120614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732120612,
					"content": "派蒙害怕的話，可以先回去呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120613
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732120613,
					"content": "#我不要，誰說我害怕啦！哼…況且{F#妳}{M#你}也一定離不開我呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 732120614,
					"content": "搶劫車隊的人，也許還埋伏在附近。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732120615
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732120615,
					"content": "#唔，{F#妳}{M#你}說的好可怕…哼，但既然{F#妳}{M#你}都不怕，我們就繼續順著道路探查吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
